---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-gris bg-papel-soft">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span
            class="grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-accent text-papel ring-1 ring-accent-deep/40"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="h-3.5 w-3.5"
            >
              <path d="M2 7h11v9H2z"></path>
              <path d="M13 10h4l3 3v3h-7"></path>
              <circle cx="6.5" cy="17.5" r="1.6"></circle>
              <circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.6"></circle>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-[14px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Reparto Veloz SRL</span>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-[34ch] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Delivery de paquetes en CABA y GBA centro. Tres vehículos propios,
          trazabilidad por código de pedido.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-muted">Contacto</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] text-ink">
          <li>
            <a href="tel:+541147771100" class="hover:text-accent-deep">
              <span class="font-mono text-[12px]">+54 11 4777-1100</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:soporte@repartoveloz.example" class="hover:text-accent-deep">
              soporte@repartoveloz.example
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="text-ink-soft">WhatsApp · Lun a Sáb 9 a 20 h</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-muted">Ayuda rápida</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] text-ink">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-accent-deep">Consultar un pedido</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#como-funciona" class="hover:text-accent-deep">¿Cómo funciona?</a></li>
          <li class="text-ink-soft">Demo · datos simulados</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-gris pt-5 text-[12px] text-ink-soft sm:flex-row sm:items-center"
    >
      <span>© {year} Reparto Veloz SRL · Proyecto de muestra</span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em]">v0.1.0</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
